# Phase 20m — evidence from the live cycle watched through one tab

The tab was opened BEFORE the cycle was ordered and was never reloaded, never
navigated, and never closed until the cycle ended. Browser: Safari on macOS —
the first time the page has been watched in a browser `make
page-freshness-check` does not drive (it drives chromium).

NOT CONFIRMED, and recorded as such rather than assumed: whether the page's own
`Refresh` button was pressed at any point during the cycle. The participant was
asked three times and did not answer. Every claim below that says "without a
reload" is exactly that — no reload — and does NOT claim no Refresh.

