## Teardown confirmed against the AWS CLI, not against Terraform state

```text
account 993912191738
ecs:    rds:    alb:    nat:    eks:
```

The account line is not decoration: it is what makes the five empty lines
evidence. `aws sts get-caller-identity` runs first and every result is assigned
under an `&&` chain, so an expired SSO token aborts instead of printing five
blanks that look exactly like a clean account.

